    <string name="how_to_trace_body">1. Choose an animal and tap Trace this drawing.\n\n2. Allow camera access and place your phone securely above your paper.\n\n3. Drag and pinch the drawing to align it, then adjust opacity.\n\n4. Lock the overlay and trace the lines on your paper. Use the flashlight if needed.</string>
    <string name="privacy_placeholder">Your drawings stay on your device. Camera previews and selected images are used only for tracing; this app does not record or upload them. Favorites, recent drawings, and settings are stored locally and may be included in your device backup. Only images you choose through Android Photo Picker are accessible. No accounts, ads, analytics, or tracking are used. Sharing, rating, and your device’s photo provider are handled by other apps.</string>
